      "review_description": "From 1st contact I found the installer very professional and willing to listen to what I wanted and what I expected from a system. All my questions throughout the process were answered quickly and to my satisfaction. The installer gave me an insulation date however due to rain this was pushed back 1 day, which the installer rang me prior and informed me. On the day of installation they turned up on time ready for install and they were all polite respectful tradespeople. I was extremely happy with the installation as it was a very neat and tidy job. After they finished wiring it all up and labeled everything they explained how it worked, what switches did what etc. I was extremely impressed with the quality of the work and would highly recommend Macquarie Energy for solar installations. I also got batteries for back up.",
