      "review_description": "Thanks Macquarie Energy for taking two trips to Forbes from Dubbo to measure/quote and then install my solar system. Angus (company director) and Dale (head electrician) were both efficient and professional in all aspects of communication and service when quoting, installing and following up e.g: honest, open to discuss various options, clear about alternatives, and provided written quote full of information about the products, warranties and so on, and were quick to respond to enquiries. I received links to the app to track the system within hours of the job being complete and they managed the grid connection after the install seamlessly. Macquarie Energy were able to do a site measure/quote within a week of my request and the job within approx 6 weeks, on time and budget even with lots of rainy weather around the time. It was a small job 3.9kw but they treated me like a priority customer despite the high level of demand around at the moment and the fact that I was in a town 3hrs from their base. I was very happy with the process. The installation is neat and I feel happy to see the glistening panels and flashing lights on the inverter and be contributing to green energy. My little duplex house also looks much more modern and attractive. For me it wasn’t all about profit I just wanted something I can afford and feel a bit greener and as a buffer from the the electricity companies price variation. I’d love to get a battery next! Solarquotes were on the mark highly recommending Macquarie Energy! Thank you!3.9kw PV arraySungrow SG3KD – 10yrs Warranty10 x Trina 390w Premium Vertex Modules – 15yrs Product warranty & 25yrs Performance warrantyClenergy Premium Framing15yr Workmanship WarrantyFully Installed after a rebate of $1824.00$4119.00 Inc Gst $26/week",
